    "眠ることを強制せず、今日の緊張が薄くなるまで静かに付き添う。": "I won't force you to sleep, and I will quietly accompany you until the stress of today fades away.",
    "毛布の重さ、足元まで区切られた安全な空間、布のごく小さな音。": "The weight of the blanket, the safe space that separates your feet, the tiny sound of the cloth.",
